  TextQuestion: "C\xF4ng nh\xE2n \u1EA3o \u0111ang \u0111\u1EE9ng \u1EDF khu v\u1EF1c
    nguy hi\u1EC3m n\xE0o?\""
  TextListAnswer:
  - "[A] V\xF9ng thi c\xF4ng c\xF3 ti\u1EBFng \u1ED3n v\u01B0\u1EE3t m\u1EE9c cho
    ph\xE9p."
  - "[B] V\xF9ng ph\xE1t th\u1EA3i kh\xED \u0111\u1ED9c t\u1EEB \u0111\u1ED9ng c\u01A1."
  - "[C] V\xF9ng m\xF9 thi\u1EBFt b\u1ECB (Blind Spot) - T\xE0i x\u1EBF kh\xF4ng
    th\u1EC3 quan s\xE1t."
  correctAnwer: 2
